  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.Sensor(Name: string, ID: uuid, Type: number, Range: number, Arc: number)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llSensor(string Name, key ID, integer Type, float Range, float Arc);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Performs a single scan for <b>name</b> and <b>id</b> with <b>type</b> within <b>radius</b> meters and <b>arc</b> radians of forward vector.</p>
  <p>Script execution continues immediately. When the scan is completed, a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Sensor" target="_blank">sensor</a> or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/No_sensor" target="_blank">no_sensor</a> event is put in the event queue.</p>
</p>
