  <p>If <b>name</b> and/or <b>id</b> are empty, they are ignored.</p>
  <p>If <b>id</b> is an invalid key or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/NULL_KEY" target="_blank">NULL_KEY</a> it is treated as empty.</p>
  <p>Depending upon which AGENT* flag is used determines the format requirements for <b>name</b></p>
  <p>See: <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20150426032518/http://www.lslwiki.net/lslwiki/wakka.php?wakka=llSensor" target="_blank">llSensor</a> for an excellent explanation of <b>arc</b>.</p>
